  displayName: Giant Rat
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8136d491436de542aa3453d7c5c8418, type: 3}
  description: Giant rats are undersized ratkins, about dog-sized and clearly small
    compared to humanoids. They have long, hairless tails that whip and balance them
    as they scurry. Their bodies hug the ground with fast, skittering movement, darting
    into holes and shadows. The sounds they make are all animalistic - squeaks, hisses,
    and chittering - never words.
